es with the people currently entitled to the money, and pay the urgent inspection fee on time. I want the equipment cheque stopped and replaced if the bank can still stop it; if it has already been presented, count its actual payment and do not pay it again. Keep at least USD 50 available at completion. I have no extra funding and do not know the bank’s actual stop or clearing result.\n\nPlease treat both as one operating plan and recalculate the remaining obligation from actual results as they arrive.",
